+# Phone shots: the reply control in Chat V1, V2 and V3
+
+360×740 at 2x, touch, UA `Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) … Chrome/156.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36`, fixture data, `lew42.recite.auto` off. Each shows ▶ and ↺10 on its own row under the reply text.
+
+- `phone-v3.png`: `/framework/ext/Chat/v3/`
+- `phone-v2.png`: `/framework/ext/Chat/v2/`
+- `phone-v1.png`: the dictation widget's thread (`ux/Dictate/Widget.js`), built by hand on `/framework/start/` the way `audio/Recite/ReciteBubble.test.mjs` builds it (not the Start page's own layout).
+
+Taken on the branch's own dev server before the merge (the main site could not show the code yet); `shots/` is gitignored, so these live here.
